**Verdict:** columns **2/5**. Same Katharevousa mix as part a. No masculine form for Wei Tseng. **012** is the most readable; **011** is the weakest public page; **013** and **015** still read as Korean blog posts.

**12 P1 issues** include: «η μόνη απόφαση» for “judgment alone”; CCTV «επικαλυφθούν»; Korean brands as the default reader; «επιρροές» for influencers; Japanese Invest Taiwan URL; FAQ «Όχι.» under the wrong heading; «απόσβεση» for employment termination; «ανά πάσα στιγμή» availability; «οικογένεια που απομένει»; «Συνιστάται» (recommended vs incorporated); «συνέντευξη» for consultation.

